I have fully implemented the `clam_pearl_guard` XR game according to the specification and all campaign hard rules.

### Summary of Work:
1. **`ClamPearlGuardConfig.cs`**: Defined all constants and tuning parameters with units.
2. **`ClamPearlGuardCores.cs`**: Implemented all required pure C# classes (`PalmFrame`, `PearlRegistration`, `CurlEstimator`, `CageClassifier`, `SunCharger`, `BarracudaDirector`, `PearlState`, `ClamRenderer`, `TideDirector`, `FeedbackDirector`, and `SessionFSM`) without any placeholder methods or `NotImplementedException`.
3. **`clam_pearl_guardRig.cs`**: Created the thin MonoBehaviour wiring the core logic.
4. **`Scripts/Editor/AcceptanceTests.cs`**: Implemented automated NUnit tests for section-16 specifications (`Test01`, `Test03`, `Test04`, `Test05`, `Test06`, `Test08`) and properly categorized hardware-dependent tests with `[Category(NeedsDevice)]`.
5. **`BUILD_LOG.md`**: Created the complete build log detailing implemented classes, constants sources, test status, and honest limitations.
